# Mizline Brand Colors

Use these tokens everywhere — never hardcode one-off hex values outside this palette.

## Primary Palette

| Token | Hex |
|-------|-----|
| Primary (Coffee Brown) | `#3B2F2F` |
| Accent (Warm Orange) | `#E67E22` |
| Secondary (Latte Beige) | `#D6B48A` |
| Background (Warm White) | `#FCFAF7` |
| Surface / Card | `#FFFFFF` |
| Text Primary | `#1A1A1A` |
| Text Secondary | `#6B7280` |
| Border | `#E5E7EB` |

## Semantic Colors

| Token | Hex |
|-------|-----|
| Success | `#2E8B57` |
| Warning | `#F59E0B` |
| Error | `#DC2626` |
| Info | `#2563EB` |

