## Tailwind / CSS Variables

Define in `@theme` or a shared `mizlineColors` export:

```ts
export const mizlineColors = {
  primary: "#3B2F2F",
  accent: "#E67E22",
  secondary: "#D6B48A",
  background: "#FCFAF7",
  surface: "#FFFFFF",
  text: { primary: "#1A1A1A", secondary: "#6B7280" },
  border: "#E5E7EB",
  success: "#2E8B57",
  warning: "#F59E0B",
  error: "#DC2626",
  info: "#2563EB",
  orderStatus: {
    new: "#3B82F6",
    preparing: "#F59E0B",
    ready: "#10B981",
    fulfilled: "#6B7280",
    cancelled: "#EF4444",
  },
};
```

## Usage

- **Primary button**: bg `#3B2F2F`, hover `#2A2020`, text `#FFFFFF`
- **Primary actions** (Place Order, Checkout, Mark Ready, Save): bg `#E67E22`, text `#FFFFFF`
- **App background**: `#FCFAF7` · **Cards**: `#FFFFFF` · **Borders**: `#E5E7EB`
- **Kitchen columns**: map each status to its order-status color for instant recognition

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD — semantic token
<button className="bg-primary text-white hover:bg-[#2A2020]">Save</button>

// ❌ BAD — arbitrary hex outside palette
<div className="bg-[#4a3728]">...</div>
```
